  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{BF}_{3}$ does not follow octate rule because central atom, boron lacks an electron pair. Thus, it also acts as Lewis acid.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0028_99b8640e9633.png\">"
